1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,556
Every child has ideas. ByteBuddies helps turn those ideas
into things they can make.

2
00:00:05,856 --> 00:00:12,840
Pupils explore interactive lessons, learn to code,
and build games in one primary computing platform.

3
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:19,552
They solve story-led coding challenges,
experimenting, testing, and learning to debug.

4
00:00:19,852 --> 00:00:24,374
They can design their own robots
and bring ideas to life in 3D worlds.

5
00:00:24,674 --> 00:00:30,480
Teachers can set work, track progress,
and give thoughtful feedback in one place.

6
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:37,310
From a first line of code to a project of their own,
learning becomes active, creative, and visible.

7
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,952
ByteBuddies. Make learning.
Make things happen.